{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to </strong><strong><i>Blyte</i></strong><strong>, an absurd, funny, and delightfully pointless walking simulator one more... or not.</strong> <br>You play as EVA. But honestly\u2026 it doesn\u2019t really matter. No heroic destiny, no magical powers. Just you, a scythe (maybe), and a world that decided to ignore all the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal landscapes, uncover useless secrets, talk to characters who have nothing to say, and experience an adventure that breaks every rule \u2014 even its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>What <i>Blyte</i> offers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark humor, trolling, and parody at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stylized, strange, and (almost) coherent world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise mechanics that change when you think you understand them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack that tries to set the mood, but is judging you a little.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero combat, zero mercy, zero regrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blyte is like life: confusing, chaotic, but you keep moving forward anyway.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861920?t=1754098221","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/84846f388b6a4ee3daf12c7f2395c643aadda341/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754098221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/2a9f1523f8583fd03a6ec8104ec5395771dc838a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754098221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861920/2a9f1523f8583fd03a6ec8104ec5395771dc838a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754098221","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":